    "title": "Race and compete.",
    "text": "Activities / Sports Race and compete. Competitive players have a few options in the city. IceGP Racing Boat races on the ice track. Races end after 600 seconds, or 40 seconds after the first player crosses the finish line. Solo races are 1 lap. Several boat types are available. BlockBall Go to a football stadium in the city to play football with other players. Fight Club Challenge another player to a Deathmatch or a best of three Knockout match. Keep track of your rank and your wins. This mode is still a work in progress.",
