    "title": "Come back every day.",
    "text": "Activities / Daily Rewards Come back every day. Two systems reward you for playing regularly. Daily Quests Use /quests to see your daily quests. Quests come in easy, medium and hard difficulty and ask you to mine, chop wood, fish, farm, hunt, deliver goods, talk to NPCs and more. Rewards are money or XP. Login Streak Log in on consecutive days to build a streak and use /loginstreak once per day to claim a reward. Special rewards wait at 10, 30, 50, 100, 200, 300, 365, 500, 750 and 1,000 days. If you stay away for more than three days, your streak resets.",
