    "text": "Businesses / Economy Prices & reputation. Your reputation affects how much you pay. Players with a very high reputation get shop discounts, players with a very low reputation pay a surcharge. Most shops also have a limited daily stock , so popular items can sell out. Bank interest Money in your bank account earns interest every hour, even while you are offline. The rate depends on your reputation. Reputation Interest per hour Honored 2% Respected 1.5% Neutral 1% Shady 0.7% Criminal 0.5% Life insurance When you die, half of your pocket money drops at the place where you died as a money check. Life insurance costs 5,000€ once and 3,000€ per day. With it you only lose a small part instead of half, between 5% (Honored) and 25% (Criminal) depending on your reputation.",
